    {
      "claim": "StratonovichHAMSecondMoment.MaskedSpectralGrowth.charFun_smul_withDensity: no direct label",
      "verdict": "PASS",
      "reason": "MaskedSpectralGrowth.lean:192-195 permits arbitrary “k : ℝ≥0∞” and uses “k.toReal”, precisely as ledger:1646 and claims.yaml:4091 state. Main TeX:704-705 contains no corresponding weighted characteristic-function lemma. Its possibly infinite scalar and totalized-integral semantics are not misrepresented as ordinary finite-measure conclusions."
