    {
      "claim": "StratonovichHAMSecondMoment.MaskedSpectralGrowth.scaling_constants: no direct label",
      "verdict": "PASS",
      "reason": "MaskedSpectralGrowth.lean:205-207 assumes “0 < c”, arbitrary real alpha and natural d, and gives the identity paraphrased in ledger:1647 and claims.yaml:4098. Rewriting π/(1/4)=4π and π/(1/(4c²))=4πc² is exact. Main TeX:704-705 contains no such constants lemma, so no direct label is correct."
