    {
      "claim": "StratonovichHAMSecondMoment.MaskedSpectralGrowth.spectralHomogeneous_of_scaling: L:damped-homogeneous-norms",
      "verdict": "PASS",
      "reason": "MaskedSpectralGrowth.lean:301-303 assumes precisely μ tempered, the spectral convention and Γ scaling, and concludes “SpectralHomogeneous μ alpha”; no exponent range is added. Ledger:1649 and claims.yaml:4112 match. Main TeX:704-705 and :4522-4525 derive exactly μ(cA)=c^αμ(A) under H:homog. The generalization is explicit and preserves the manuscript implication."
