    {
      "claim": "StratonovichHAMSecondMoment.MaskedSpectralGrowth.MGamma: P:masked-spectral-growth",
      "verdict": "PASS",
      "reason": "MaskedSpectralGrowth.lean:322 defines “∫ x, Real.exp (-(‖x‖²/4)) ∂Γ”, matching ledger:1651 and claims.yaml:4126. TeX:35-37 defines the identical M_Γ under the section's H:homog and Γ≠0 assumptions (:5-6). The unrestricted Lean definition is harmless, and the ledger explicitly distinguishes its Bochner-integral semantics from proved integrability."
